// Ch6 B02 "The smoke" (act1_ch06.md; W04). On the last wreck-ridge Toma stops walking first, before
// the smoke is in frame: he knows the smell. Pan only after he stops (W04, then W04_smoke). The music
// drops out under the crackle. ~15 words.
title: ch06_smoke
location: ch06/brine_shoals
---
@camera W04
@mark toma ridge_stop walk
@anim toma stop
@wait 1.2
@camera W04_smoke blend=2.0
@sfx camp_burn
@wait 1.0
Rhen [neutral]: Somebody's cookfire. #line:ch06_smoke_001
Toma [afraid]: No. #line:ch06_smoke_002
@music silence fade=1.5
@wait 1.0
